          "text": "This page lists various resources, beyond those included in the bibliography, that have been crucial in the creation of this project. Behind every project, is a group of everyday people, archivists, librarians, students, teachers, administrators, digital experts, scholars, curators, artists, organizers, and many more people who directly and indirectly impact what is preserved, accessible, and how we understand it."
        }
